  "steps": [
    "Dry-roast the coriander seeds and dried red chillies for 1 minute and crush them coarsely.",
    "Heat the oil in a kadai, add the chopped onion and cook until golden, then add the ginger garlic paste for 1 minute.",
    "Add the tomato puree, turmeric, chilli powder, salt and the crushed spices and cook for 8-10 minutes until thick and oily.",
    "Add the water and bring to a simmer for 3 minutes.",
    "Add the paneer, capsicum and onion petals and mix gently.",
    "Cook covered for 5 minutes so the capsicum stays slightly crunchy.",
    "Finish with kasuri methi, garam masala and coriander leaves."
  ]
